{"baseRefName":"main","body":"## Summary\n- refresh the Phase 0 stable-release aggregate source guard to current main after PR #680 at 92a6df59216cddfe2f1eb53a87f6245d18533a15\n- extend the audited merged PR range through PR #680 and add the after-680 blocked evidence bundle\n- keep Phase 0 blocked: source_guard, owner_pr_guard, and merged_pr_guard pass, while the seven real required runtime/product gates remain open, blocked, or insufficient\n- fix the checked-in audit/open-PR snapshot date to the UTC collection date so GitHub Actions does not reject it as future-dated\n\n## Verification\n- PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 PYTHONPATH=tools python3 -m unittest tools.tests.test_phase0_stable_release.Phase0StableReleaseTest.test_checked_in_manifest_keeps_phase0_open -v\n- PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 -m unittest tests.phase3.test_repository_privacy.RepositoryPrivacyTests.test_current_tree_has_no_raw_android_serial_contexts -v\n- make evidence-tools-test\n- make phase0-stable-release-gate PHASE0_STABLE_RELEASE_EXPECTED_SOURCE_COMMIT=92a6df59216cddfe2f1eb53a87f6245d18533a15 PHASE0_STABLE_RELEASE_SUMMARY=docs/changes/2026-08-22-phase0-stable-release-aggregate/evidence/2026-09-08-after-680-current-main-gate-blocked/phase0-stable-release-summary.json\n- shasum -a 256 -c docs/changes/2026-08-22-phase0-stable-release-aggregate/evidence/2026-09-08-after-680-current-main-gate-blocked/SHA256SUMS\n- git diff --check\n\n## Boundaries\n- No Vibe Screen, MacHost, or Telemachus GUI was launched.\n- No swift run, Screen Recording, Accessibility, Microphone, Keychain, TCC, System Settings, or adb reverse tcp:54321 command was used.\n- This does not mark Phase 0 stable, complete, shipped, or closed.\n","closedAt":"2026-09-07T23:48:50Z","files":[{"path":"README.md","additions":2,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-phase0-stable-release-aggregate/README.md","additions":39,"deletions":22,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-phase0-sta